For the AI Tools Question (Leftmost Row):
Using AI tools for advice is convenient and often feels efficient. But can AI truly understand the complexities of your situation? AI will give you generic responses like “Stay positive” or “Be patient.” While these are nice ideas, they lack depth and context.

Instead, why not call a trusted mentor, a family member, or even a colleague? Human advice is tailored to your specific challenges and often comes with real-life examples or actionable steps. AI might know facts, but it can’t offer the wisdom or emotional nuance that comes from experience and empathy.
